  "description": "Optional add-on for League of Legends Heroes: Zeri as in League. Ultrashock Laser: a pulse that meets a wall (a wall cell of the map or the map's edge) turns into a long laser from there, hitting and slowing every enemy behind it - the data pack cannot read walls, so there only a minion or monster stops the pulse into a laser. Living Battery: her damage on an enemy shield steals 45% of what the shield stopped as her own shield for 3 s - the data pack cannot read shields, so there her charged shot gives a small shield instead. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-02",
